
- make inside build:

"Preps" cmake in your repo

	cmake -S . -B build

Compiles your files:

 	" cmake --build build "

Loads the binary onto your pico (and flash):

 	" picotool load -f build/src/hello_freertos.elf "


----------------- NOTE: ----------------------

Pico must be in boot select mode to flash --> "picotool reboot -f -u "
Pico must be in app mode to actually run --> " picotool reboot -f "